  <item>
    <title>Vol.023_《百年孤独》不仅仅是一本文学著作</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676fc17115a5fd520e3ea6c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676fc17115a5fd520e3ea6c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Dec 2024 09:22:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>网飞新剧全球排行榜首《百年孤独》，大家都看过了吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目跟大家讲讲我们翻译界大佬范晔老师当年负责这部译作的心酸史。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时剖析原著小说中的“禁忌之恋”、“恋童”，将从平台、教育与法律3个角度讨论未成年人保护与当今网络创作生态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家看书或者刷剧有与我不同的感悟，欢迎在评论区给我留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后送给大家一段摘自《百年孤独》的话：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“我们趋行在人生这个亘古的旅途，在坎坷中奔跑，在挫折里涅槃。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;忧愁缠满全身，痛苦飘洒一滴。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;我们累，却无从止歇；</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;我们苦，却无法回避。”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《百年孤独》不仅仅是一本文学著作，它具有更深层的普世意义。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQRlWUiUT6cbfKxU40QIOVgW7ym.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Music list：</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>Breathtaker (Piano Solo)</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Creación Macondo</span></em></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpA8OzI_L_mOuZ4IL6Ywl4L0HjOk.m4a" length="30484365" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgFXsMsJzM3E0D82Wt3wHPXFP0z.png"/>
